          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "समितिः — samitiḥ — \"a committee\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "समितिः श्वः निर्णयं करिष्यति। samitiḥ śvaḥ nirṇayaṃ kariṣyati. The committee will decide tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "समितिः (samitiḥ) is built on sam, \"together\", and the root √i, \"to go\"; MW gives sam-iti \"a meeting, an assembly, a council\", and \"a committee\" is its modern sense (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
